OL,3,ANo shoot-to-kill missions against IRA,
OL,4,Asays former SAS officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the Troubles Bill,
OL,7,Fwhich seeks to deal with unresolved
OL,8,Flegacy of the decades-long violent
OL,9,Fconflict, "includes effective
OL,10,Fsafeguards for any veteran".
